{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110639","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110639/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110639/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110639/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110639","id":3428259171,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6pLiiq","number":110639,"title":"Fix missing CPU pause instruction for Loongarch64 in SpinLock.","user":{"login":"MBCX","id":63003002,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMDAzMDAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63003002?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX","html_url":"https://github.com/MBCX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MBCX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5793,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T14:39:14Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-18T01:13:06Z","updated_at":"2026-02-17T20:10:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110639","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110639","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110639.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110639.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Loongarch64 support was added in #97822, but the `_cpu_pause()` function was missing an assembly instruction. This meant that when compiling (either cross-compilation or native), the function would effectively be a no-op and likely be optimized out by the compiler, causing very fun hard-to-debug synchronization issues on real hardware.\r\n\r\n~~While Loongarch doesn't have an ARM-style `yield` instruction, the `nop` instruction is the most appropriate choice according to the [Loongarch manual](https://loongson.github.io/LoongArch-Documentation/LoongArch-Vol1-EN.html#_nop). It's guaranteed to advance the PC (Program Counter) by 4 bytes with no other side effects, so I chose it as a CPU \"pause\" hint.~~\r\n\r\nEdit: I changed instead to use the C intrinsic `__ibar(0)` after [this suggestion](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110639#issuecomment-3675019388)\r\n\r\nI also added memory clobbers (`\"memory\"`) to the other assembly operations to prevent the compiler from reordering these during optimisation, which could again cause hard-to-debug issues and potentially break the intended behaviour.\r\n\r\nNote: While I've been doing tons of cross-compilation work I'm not a Loongarch assembly expert, so if there's a more optimal instruction for this, then feel free.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110639/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110639/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}